    "Remote: pair a wireless remote (BR-E1) in the camera's Bluetooth menu and set the drive mode to Self-timer: 10 s/remote or 2 s/remote. Smartphone (adds geotags): pair a smartphone, choose OK on the camera, then set GPS device settings › Select GPS device › Smartphone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fernbedienung: Kopple im Bluetooth-Menü der Kamera eine Funk-Fernbedienung (BR-E1) und stelle die Betriebsart auf Self-timer: 10 s/remote oder 2 s/remote. Smartphone (mit Geotags): Kopple ein Smartphone, wähle OK an der Kamera und stelle dann GPS device settings › Select GPS device › Smartphone ein."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remoto: empareja un mando inalámbrico (BR-E1) en el menú Bluetooth de la cámara y pon el modo de avance en Self-timer: 10 s/remote o 2 s/remote. Smartphone (añade geoetiquetas): empareja un smartphone, elige OK en la cámara y luego ve a GPS device settings › Select GPS device › Smartphone."
          }
        },
        "es-419": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remoto: empareja un control remoto inalámbrico (BR-E1) en el menú Bluetooth de la cámara y pon el modo de avance en Self-timer: 10 s/remote o 2 s/remote. Smartphone (agrega geoetiquetas): empareja un smartphone, elige OK en la cámara y luego ve a GPS device settings › Select GPS device › Smartphone."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Télécommande : jumelez une télécommande sans fil (BR-E1) dans le menu Bluetooth de l’appareil et réglez le mode d’acquisition sur Self-timer: 10 s/remote ou 2 s/remote. Smartphone (ajoute le géomarquage) : jumelez un smartphone, choisissez OK sur l’appareil, puis réglez GPS device settings › Select GPS device › Smartphone."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "रिमोट: कैमरे के Bluetooth मेनू में वायरलेस रिमोट (BR-E1) पेयर करें और ड्राइव मोड को Self-timer: 10 s/remote या 2 s/remote पर सेट करें। स्मार्टफ़ोन (जियोटैग जोड़ता है): स्मार्टफ़ोन पेयर करें, कैमरे पर OK चुनें, फिर GPS device settings › Select GPS device › Smartphone सेट करें।"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remote: pasangkan remote nirkabel (BR-E1) di menu Bluetooth kamera dan atur mode drive ke Self-timer: 10 s/remote atau 2 s/remote. Smartphone (menambah geotag): pasangkan smartphone, pilih OK di kamera, lalu atur GPS device settings › Select GPS device › Smartphone."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Telecomando: abbina un telecomando wireless (BR-E1) nel menu Bluetooth della fotocamera e imposta la modalità di scatto su Self-timer: 10 s/remote o 2 s/remote. Smartphone (aggiunge il geotag): abbina uno smartphone, scegli OK sulla fotocamera, poi imposta GPS device settings › Select GPS device › Smartphone."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リモート：カメラのBluetoothメニューでワイヤレスリモコン（BR-E1）としてペアリングし、ドライブモードを「Self-timer: 10 s/remote」または「2 s/remote」に設定します。スマートフォン（ジオタグも使えます）：スマートフォンとしてペアリングし、カメラで「OK」を選んでから、「GPS device settings › Select GPS device › Smartphone」に設定します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "리모컨: 카메라의 Bluetooth 메뉴에서 무선 리모컨(BR-E1)으로 페어링하고, 드라이브 모드를 Self-timer: 10 s/remote 또는 2 s/remote로 설정합니다. 스마트폰(지오태그 추가): 스마트폰으로 페어링하고 카메라에서 OK를 선택한 다음, GPS device settings › Select GPS device › Smartphone으로 설정합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Controle remoto: emparelhe um controle remoto sem fio (BR-E1) no menu Bluetooth da câmera e ajuste o modo de avanço para Self-timer: 10 s/remote ou 2 s/remote. Smartphone (adiciona geomarcação): emparelhe um smartphone, escolha OK na câmera e depois ajuste GPS device settings › Select GPS device › Smartphone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遥控：在相机的蓝牙菜单中配对无线遥控器（BR-E1），并将驱动模式设为 Self-timer: 10 s/remote 或 2 s/remote。智能手机（可加地理标记）：配对智能手机，在相机上选择 OK，然后设置 GPS device settings › Select GPS device › Smartphone。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遙控：在相機的藍牙選單中配對無線遙控器（BR-E1），並將驅動模式設為 Self-timer: 10 s/remote 或 2 s/remote。智慧型手機（可加地理標記）：配對智慧型手機，在相機上選擇 OK，然後設定 GPS device settings › Select GPS device › Smartphone。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
